#: plugins/LinuxPerf/LinuxPerfPlugin.cpp:397
#, qt-format
msgctxt "QObject|"
msgid "Injects the MangoHud overlay into Minecraft via the mangohud wrapper.\n"
"Displays real-time FPS, frame timing, GPU and CPU metrics.\n"
"Works with both OpenGL and Vulkan (LWJGL2 / LWJGL3).\n\n"
"Found: %1"
